        </AlertDescription>
      </Alert>
      </li>
      <li>You have enabled host encryption mode on all of the ESXi hosts that are hosting the cluster. For more information, see <a href="https://docs.vmware.com/en/VMware-vSphere/7.0/com.vmware.vsphere.security.doc/GUID-A9E1F016-51B3-472F-B8DE-803F6BDB70BC.html">Enabling host encryption mode</a>.</li>
      <li>You have a vSphere account which has all cryptographic privileges enabled. For more information, see <a href="https://docs.vmware.com/en/VMware-vSphere/7.0/com.vmware.vsphere.security.doc/GUID-660CCB35-847F-46B3-81CA-10DDDB9D7AA9.html">Cryptographic Operations Privileges</a>.</li>
